; The all-sample inference report, shared by the ATen runner (test/interp_run.ml)
; and the pure-engine one (js/run/pt2_run.ml).
;
; The dependency list IS the point of this library. No [interp], no [aten], no
; [ctypes] -- and no [unix], which is why [run] takes the clock as [~now] rather
; than calling [Unix.gettimeofday] itself. Everything here has to survive
; js_of_ocaml, so a dependency added below can silently cost the JavaScript
; runner its build. `make jsoo.pt2.run`'s closure check in
; .ai/js_backends_design.md is what catches that.

(library
 (name infer_report)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries err_trace fmt jsont jsont.bytesrw pt2))
